t to ", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "id": 0}, {"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "to deal with that complaint. ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": " You might want\t", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "id": 1}, {"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "wait until things escalate.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "You shouldn't\t", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "id": 2}], "type": "MT1", "id": 10, "stimuli_ids": []}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "RSLT", "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and the Rude Customer", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Stress-Free Work Environment", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Food for Thought > Overeating", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 5, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Identify and provide solutions to problems in a range of social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Expressing What is Necessary", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use modals like <span class=\"italic\">should</span> and <span class=\"italic\">must</span> or expressions like <span class=\"italic\">You have got to \u2026</span> or <span class=\"italic\">You are going to have to ...</span> to express what is necessary.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use the following to express what is necessary:<ul><li>You had better ... </li> <li>You have got to ... </li> <li>I'm going to have to ... </li> <li>You need to ... </li><li>You ought ...</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Manager</span>: You need to lighten up a little. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: That's easy for you to say. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Manager</span>: You'd better stop taking everything so seriously!", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Adverbs of Manner", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Adverbs of Manner add more information to verbs to make them more specific. They usually come after the main verb. <br>Example: <br /><span class=\"italic\">She walked.  vs. She walked slowly.<br> How did she walk? Slowly.<br/></span>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "I make sure that every meal goes smoothly.", "type": "example"}, {"content": " We need to handle our customers firmly but cheerfully.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Many adverbs are formed by adding <span class=\"strong\">-ly</span> to an adjective:<br> <span class=\"italic\">Examples: quick - quickly, slow - slowly<br><br> </span>  Some adverbs are formed by adding <span class=\"strong\">-ily</span> to adjectives ending in -y:<br><span class=\"italic\"> Example: angry - angrily<br><br></span>  The adverbs <span class=\"strong\">fast</span>, <span class=\"strong\">hard</span>, <span class=\"strong\">well</span> and <span class=\"strong\">straight</span> are exceptions. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Adverb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"magical<br> serious\\t<br>\\t\\t happy\\t<br>\\t smooth\\t<br>\\t firm\\t<br>\\t cheerful<br>\\t\\t inappropriate\\t<br>\\t hard\\t\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" magically<br> seriously<br> happily<br> smoothly<br> firmly<br> cheerfully<br> inappropriately<br> hard\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "We must handle the situation carefully. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "He sometimes behaves inappropriately. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "wound ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an injury caused by a cut ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I know all about knife wounds!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to describe a stressful situation at work.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "thick-skinned ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "insensitive to criticism or insults ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You need to be more thick-skinned!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "magically ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " in a magical manner ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: How is it going to magically happen?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "for starters ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to begin with; first of all ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: For starters, you shouldn't take everything so seriously.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "smoothly ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in a smooth manner ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need to make sure that every meal goes smoothly.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "firmly ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in a firm manner", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: You should deal with difficult customers firmly.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob09aud06 ", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cheerfully", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in a cheerful manner ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You ought to welcome our guests cheerfully.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "inappropriately", "type": "name"}, {"content": " in an inappropriate manner ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: A customer behaved inappropriately yesterday.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob09aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to escalate ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make a situation worse ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You shouldn't let a difficult situation escalate.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob09aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go online and find information about stress in the workplace.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a list of the top 5 most stressful jobs, according to your research.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find out why people feel stressed in each job.  ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about your list with your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Compare your list with your partner's. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I research information about stress at work and healthy habits at work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a list of 5 stressful jobs. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share the list with my partner.", "type": "text"}]}]}